dela porque a ama.

446
00:28:38,340 --> 00:28:40,860
Imos, levántese.
Pare de dicir asneiras,

447
00:28:40,900 --> 00:28:42,820
senón imos atrasarnos.

448
00:28:43,300 --> 00:28:47,540
Penso que vou ficar aquí
a traballar na novela

449
